---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="404 - 页面未找到" description="您访问的页面不存在。">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-20 text-center">
    <h1 class="text-6xl font-bold mb-4 text-cyan-blue">404</h1>
    <p class="text-xl mb-8">糟糕，您要找的页面好像迷路了。</p>
    <a href="/" class="px-6 py-3 bg-coral hover:bg-red-500 text-white rounded-lg transition font-bold">返回首页</a>
  </div>
</Layout>
